WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.770
You spend every shift caring for others.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.770
So, who's caring for you?

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.200
This November,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.080
the Igbo Healthcare Professionals Network, IHPN-UK,

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.900
presents its very first talk:

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.870
on mental health and wellbeing.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:21.080
Save the date: Sunday 22 November.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.782
Shaped by our members, the session will explore

00:00:24.782 --> 00:00:27.040
the issues you told us matter most:

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.076
work-life balance, burnout,

00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:32.670
and financial pressure and the pressure to succeed.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.760
Register your interest today at ihpnuk@outlook.com,

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:42.440
or visit ihpnuk.github.io.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.090
And if you're struggling right now,

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.670
Samaritans are there for you, free, on 116 123.
